  "notes": "{髪|かみ}の{毛|け} specifically refers to hair on the head.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {髪|かみ}の{毛|け}を{切|き}る (to cut hair)\n- {髪|かみ}の{毛|け}を{洗|あら}う (to wash hair)\n- {髪|かみ}の{毛|け}が{抜|ぬ}ける (hair falls out)\n- {髪|かみ}の{毛|け}が{伸|の}びる (hair grows)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {髪|かみ}: hair (general, also means hairstyle)\n- {髪|かみ}の{毛|け}: individual hairs, or hair as substance\n- {毛|け}: hair, fur (body hair, animal fur)\n\nCOUNTER: {本|ほん} for individual strands",
